#. Tag: title
#: mainwindow.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kplato; Main window"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: mainwindow.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is the default &kplato; main window when you load an existing project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: mainwindow.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &kplato;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: mainwindow.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kplato; main window"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: mainwindow.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the top there is the menubar (1). All &kplato; functions are available "
"from the menus, which are described in detail in <xref linkend=\"commands\"/"
">."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: mainwindow.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below the menubar are located the toolbars (2) and (3). You can show or hide "
"them using the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Toolbars</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu. You can also "
"configure the toolbars (add or remove actions) using the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: mainwindow.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(3) is the view toolbar. It allows you to quickly switch between different "
"views: Gantt, Resources or Accounts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: mainwindow.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(4) is the main view. In the Gantt view currently shown on the screenshot, "
"you have 2 panes, one with the tasks names and one with the Gantt chart."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: mainwindow.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(5) is the resource pane which you can see in the Gantt and Resources views "
"but not in the Account view. It is not shown per default and you can drag "
"the separation bar to display it."
msgstr ""
